        "created_at": "2016-01-27T18:57:19.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Ah ok...I guess that makes sense that she's sort of the counter to AOE. Cause Tempest was simply the win button with the first Vengeance expansion. Still was hard, but he made it WAY easier. And yeah Killswitch, we've been having that problem too...guess my group will just need to be a lot more careful in picking our teams on Vengeance games to have someone to deal with her. Thanks for the help on this one guys, wanted to make sure that we weren't doing her effect wrong!</p>",
